Goto ReadyX0
ReadyX0:
8H64 A 2 A_GiveInventory("Wahwee_Ready0_P")
loop

Fire:
8H64 A 1 A_JumpIfInventory("UnholyBossAmmo200",200,"SPEED_GEAR_GRAZE")
Goto ReadyX
SPEED_GEAR_GRAZE:
8H64 EDC 2
LaserHoldA:
8H64 A 0 A_JumpIfInventory("UnholyBossAmmo200",2,1)
goto EndLaser
8H64 F 0 A_TakeInventory("UnholyBossAmmo200",5)
